database (["blinded":({"profezzorn",({"Livings",}),"This property prevents a player or monster from seeing in light.It works by affecting set_light.See also: night_vision",({}),({}),"*",805677535,}),"night_vision":({"profezzorn",({"Livings",}),"This property let's a player or monster see in the dark.It works by affecting set_light.See also: blinded",({}),({}),"*",805677425,}),"floor":({"slater",({"Rooms",}),"The material of the floor/ground. ie add_property(\"floor\", \"stone\").",({}),({}),"",824903586,}),"mist":({"devik",({"Rooms",}),"A room full of mist, outside, foggy, moist and but sight is difficult.Maybe could cause tells to be obscured or some such thing?",({}),({}),"",825471839,}),"cave":({"friend",({"Rooms",}),"The room is inside a cave.",({"indoors",}),({}),"",812123507,}),"warm":({"leowon",({"Rooms",}),"This is a climate property for warm climes, for example a rain forest or a hot desert.",({}),({}),"",812065387,}),"cold":({"leowon",({"Rooms",}),"This is a climate property for cold climes, for example a glacier or a cold conifer forest.",({}),({"ice",}),"",812065533,}),"sand":({"taren",({"Rooms",}),"There is Sand in the room, example a beach.",({}),({}),"",793567732,}),"clay":({"bive",({"Objects",}),"The object is made of clay.",({"protection_fire",}),({}),"",805917485,}),"iron":({"taren",({"Objects",}),"The object is made of iron.",({"metal",}),({}),"+",793568444,}),"lead":({"restless",({"Objects","Rooms",}),"The object/room is made of lead",({"metal",}),({}),"",805915344,}),"eog":({"brom",({"Objects",}),"Eog is a magic metal, looking a bit like glass, but as strong as steeland resistant to magic. It is about as heavy as cast iron.",({"metal","no_magic",}),({}),"",794846918,}),"ruby":({"beldin",({"Objects",}),"The object is made out of ruby.",({}),({}),"",800667506,}),"holy":({"brom",({"Objects","Rooms","Monsters",}),"This property tells that the object/room/monster has some religioussignificance. It is recommended that this property returns a valuesince religion is not a strong, world-wide subject in Nanny. Thereturned value should make it possible for you to generate a suitable respons.",({}),({}),"",809805878,}),"road":({"taren",({"Rooms",}),"The room is actually a road. ",({}),({}),"",793567688,}),"deaf":({"avis",({"Monsters",}),"This is to make certain monsters unable to hear the \"wail\" of a leper if,for some reason, they can't hear.  (Also see /guilds/DOC/GUILD_leper)",({}),({}),"",795560032,}),"wind":({"gaia",({"Rooms",}),"Set the value to the direction the wind blows. That is if you standfacing south with the wind in your face then this property should be set to north.",({}),({}),"",828013789,}),"ice":({"panic",({"Rooms",}),"This property is for areas that are artic-like and have coldenvironments (North Pole, South Pole, extremely dark caves, etc).",({"cold",}),({}),"",825015952,}),"gold":({"taren",({"Objects",}),"The object is made of gold.",({"metal",}),({}),"",795981376,}),"no":({"brom",({"Objects","Rooms","Players","Livings","Monsters",}),"This property tells you that the object having it should in no way bechanged by external calls, have its properties changed or manipulatedby anyone else than its maker, i.e. the creator of it. ",({}),({}),"*",813354352,}),"no_fight":({"taren",({"Rooms",}),"If this property is set to a text, that text is                         written instead of 'Such actions are forbidden here.'.                        If you are using 'room/room', this property also                         works as query_haven();",({}),({}),"*",793558283,}),"peaceful":({"qqqq",({"Livings","Players","Monsters",}),"If set the monsters will not get any standard attacks.This includes standard magic attacks.",({}),({}),"*",805254504,}),"no_attack_switches":({"profezzorn",({"Monsters",}),"This property prevents monsters from switching target in the middle ofa fight. With the new /std/basic.c properties, this could be evaluatedto depend on who is attacking.",({}),({}),"*",809392487,}),"weapon_can't_break":({"mudlib",({"Objects",}),"This is a special property so that some weapons can't break.You may only use this property after approval from 23++.",({}),({}),"*",793976672,}),"damage_type":({"leowon",({"Livings",}),"If this property is set with a value that is a valid damage type, a living will give hit messages according to that damage type instead ofdefault messages. Example: add_property(\"damage_type\",\"slash\") would makea monster give slash messages, nice for monsters with claws and such. Notethat if a monster has a weapon wielded, the weapon hit messages takeprecedence. To see what damage types are available, see /obj/daemon/messd.c.",({}),({}),"*",827036831,}),"cursed":({"taren",({"Objects",}),"The object is cursed it can't be dropped, unworn and soo on.",({}),({}),"*",793558842,}),"waterfilled":({"rohan",({"Rooms",}),"This property is intended for rooms that are filled with water, playersin this room should also be wet.",({"water",}),({"river",}),"*",805541058,}),"silver":({"taren",({"Objects",}),"The object is made by silver.",({"metal",}),({}),"",793568371,}),"magic":({"brom",({"Objects","Rooms","Monsters",}),"This is the same property as 'magical', added since there are lots of itemswith property 'magic' around; it is the old version.",({"magical",}),({}),"*",809867913,}),"disable_slow_healing":({"taren",({"Players",}),"Use this property to disable slow healing in the player object.",({}),({}),"*",821408579,}),"holy_ground":({"rohan",({"Rooms",}),"This property should be put in chapels, churches etc.Some monsters like to check this property to stay out of some placesor take damage from beeing in such a place.",({}),({}),"*",812481734,}),"unholy_ground":({"brom",({"Rooms",}),"This property can be used for dark temples and the like. Monsters can checkfor it, don't enter it, or take damage when there.",({}),({}),"*",818975623,}),"fragile":({"taren",({"Objects",}),"When the object is droped it breaks.",({}),({"real_glass",}),"*",793567664,}),"no_weight_message":({"profezzorn",({"Objects",}),"This property suppresses the 'it looks heavy' or 'it looks very heavy'when examinining the object.",({}),({}),"*",803166886,}),"no_magic":({"qqqq",({"Rooms",}),"When defined magic can not be used in the room.",({}),({"eog",}),"",793536235,}),"two_handed":({"mudlib",({"Objects",}),"You must use both your hands when useing the object. This meansyou can't wear a shield and a twohanded weapon.",({}),({}),"*",794663354,}),"no_multi_attack":({"taren",({"Objects",}),"There is now a property, no_multi_attack, available thet if set willprevent a hit_function in a weapon to be called more than once perHB. ",({}),({}),"*",794136170,}),"indoors":({"rohan",({"Rooms",}),"This defines a room to be indoors. Example in a house.All rooms should have this property or property outdoors.",({}),({"cave",}),"*",806086648,}),"outdoors":({"rohan",({"Rooms",}),"This defines a room to be outdoors. Example in a forest.All rooms should have this property or property indoors.",({}),({"forest","plain","mountain","hills","swamp","grass","river","track",}),"*",806086334,}),"no_clean_up":({"rohan",({"Rooms",}),"Prevents the room from beeing cleaned up (supported in /std/* based rooms).",({}),({}),"*",810915945,}),"unique_item":({"taren",({"Objects",}),"The object is unique. This means the Shop will destroy the object, and it may not be stored somewhere.",({"special_item",}),({}),"",793568668,}),"air_supply":({"brom",({"Objects",}),"This property marks the item as being possible to use as an air supply,like a tube of air under water etc.",({}),({}),"",821289845,}),"no_zap":({"avis",({"Objects","Monsters",}),"A flag to determine if something is immune to the energy zapsof the Lightning Flail.",({}),({}),"",797926675,}),"protection_weapon_hit":({"taren",({"Objects","Players","Monsters","Livings",}),"The function weapon_hit in weapon.c may not cause damage to the object.",({}),({"all